{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_ethan_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_ethan_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"他乡故旧","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_ethan_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"4770ed3856dc57653077c5f6b380a44eb0e4a04bf5adb441c19031e64dd9adb7","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在过去的一年里，伊桑四处打探，寻找一位身份奇特的故人，现在他得知自己要找的人就在龙门。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"个人剧情 伊桑"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，你来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思久等了，鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"什么时候到的？昨天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"是......我和信使的车队一起来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的信使说你上个月就出发了，怎么今天才到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"车队在路上遇到一点小麻烦，遭遇了一些感染生物，不过运气还好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"没事就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你大老远跑来，就是为了这个事情？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"给，这就是你要找的那个人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"高大的警官递给小个子萨弗拉一份厚厚的文件。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，谢谢，我看看......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你确定是这个人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......我确定，不会错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我看你这一路找了不少人，你还委托了鲤氏侦探事务所吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他是你什么人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"一个很好的朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你再确定一次，真的是他吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊警官你都问了几次了，这种程度是不会认错的啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"你小子啊，还没意识到问题的严重性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他真的是你说的那个“凯文”，你明白这背后有多少麻烦事吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，我懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，老陈可真会给我找事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛在龙门的立场非常微妙，你现在要找的这个人，他的身份也是一言难尽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然名义上这是民间事务所的案件......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"但是万一出了什么事情，我可得担不少责任，你明白吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我明白的，鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这次只是我的个人委托，和罗德岛没有关系，你放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿金！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，星熊督察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"这位是金警官，今天他带你去找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，金警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"（点头）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"有什么情况立刻汇报。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"非常感谢，麻烦您了鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"谨慎点，别惹事，别在那边逗留太久。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"星熊督察说你是罗德岛的线人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......没错，我是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，陈sir最近怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，不方便说也没关系，我只是问问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我和陈警官也不是很熟悉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不过她在罗德岛上跟着其他人忙前忙后的，看起来没什么问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"嗨，那就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我们到了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"小个子萨弗拉环视了这片街区。\n袭击与战争的痕迹依然残留在这个城区中，楼房上被炮火攻击的缺口正在修补，损坏的路面上刚刚铺盖的水泥尚未干燥。\n清晨的街道依然嘈杂，贫民窟的居民穿行在低矮的楼群建筑之间，商铺的叫卖声与路边建筑施工的声音此起彼伏。\n这个城区，正在慢慢复苏。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你会说炎国官话或者龙门方言吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"会，学过一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"首先，进去了不要乱讲话，按我说的做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这边的居民对外来者的态度不算友善。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"其次，不要乱跑，也不要随便去巷子里乱逛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"一些路面还在修缮，有些建筑破损得很厉害，还没来得及拆除。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"明白，阿sir，你放心吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"三元一瓶！三元一瓶！冰镇苏打汽水！你在龙门再也找不到这么便宜的汽水了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"搬运工","speakerId":"avg_npc_005","isRemote":false,"text":"阿海，给我来一瓶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，你拿好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"就是他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"卖汽水的阿海，至少现在这里的人是这么叫他的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......卖汽水啊，我都不知道他还会做生意呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我在街道入口等你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是通讯器，有什么特殊情况记得呼救。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这东西很贵，小心别弄坏了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我和他认识很久了......应该不至于。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是老老实实带着，谨慎一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"马上安魂节了，最近警务工作都很忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是本地人，感染者街区的情况非常复杂，你这人生地不熟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真的捅出来什么篓子，周围的警力都来不及帮你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我懂，我懂，保证不会出问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉......总之你当心点。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"冰镇汽水！三元一瓶......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......哟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"生意不错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"是我，没想到咱们还能再见面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"（叹气）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你最终还是来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"汽水商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我预料到会有这么一天，只是没想到这么快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你这个反应我还真......有点没想到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"好久没见了，凯文。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"自从你去了切尔诺伯格，我们得有三年没见面了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道之前发生了什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不过你看起来过得还不错？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......还凑合吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是说点什么吧，这也太尴尬了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得咱们以前关系没有这么差吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......我没什么遗言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遛弯的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"遛弯的老人","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"是不是打搅你们了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......啊，没有没有，林大爷您早上好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷？","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，口干舌燥的，给我一瓶汽水吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"给您，收您三元。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷？","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"年纪大了腿脚不好，不介意我在你这里坐一会儿吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，您坐，您坐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"噗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"干啥，你笑什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，我只是从来没见过你这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我还记得以前一起拾荒的时候，你每天都要和那些流浪汉打一架。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你以前可没有这么和气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你还要嘲笑我两句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我不是那个意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个棚屋，你平时住在这？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这里是龙门贫民窟，绝大多数人都住在这种地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"比起以前流浪的时候，现在我至少有个遮风挡雨的住处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，我觉得挺好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"能有一个安身立命的地方，对于我们这种人来说已经难能可贵了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"那个......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"只有你一个人吗？其他人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"后来发生什么事了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你真的想知道么，你还关心这些？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"其他人......他们后来怎么样了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很奇怪吗？感染者最后都会死，就算是没有死在战场上，最后无非就是死在哪个没人的旮旯里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你还想知道，那我可以告诉你，他们大多死得不体面，满意了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你想说的都说完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果要动手，不要在这里动手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"动手？动什么手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这里的人生活不容易，如果你在这里杀了我，近卫局的人又要查封街道，会给这里的人添麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......等等。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我没搞懂你的意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是来杀我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，你等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我为什么要杀了你，你在说什么啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你不用这样，我明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你离开了整合运动，去了其他地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"看看你这身光鲜的衣服，你一定是找到了什么好去处，对吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这年头，感染者能活得这么体面，这种机会可太难得了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"不过想要维持这种体面的生活，你还有一个障碍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是我们这些人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的身份，知道你以前是整合运动的一员。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"如果我死了，就没人知道你曾经和我们这些穷凶极恶的歹徒是一伙人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我早就想过可能会有这么一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"不如说，自从三年前你告诉我你打算离开整合运动的时候，我就猜到会有这么一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"反正感染者都活不久，他们都死了，我也不觉得我能这么心安理得地继续活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（沉默）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了，为什么不说话了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......一年前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"一年前，我听说有一些整合运动的人留在了龙门。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"于是这一年我把我所有的钱都花光了，到处打听，就为了找你们几个。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我希望你们没事，我希望你们都撑过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"看起来是我想多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，你真的不是来杀我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我怎么可能......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我不知道你这几年遇到了什么事情，但是我一直当你是大哥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"在卡西米尔的时候没饭吃，你偷了罐头给我们，结果被人打了一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"在骸骨荒原流浪的时候，你带着帕奇和那些流寇斗智斗勇，我才捡回来一条命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我很感激你，如果不是你们几个，我早就死在荒地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这就是我为什么要来找你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我现在后悔了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不该来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样吧，你还活着，这就够了，我也算是放心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个给你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"矿石病抑制药，这个是说明，按照上面写的服用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我走了，你保重。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"等等！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"等一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"是我不好，我会错意了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我道歉，是我的问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我真不是故意的，我只是以为......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这几年事情太多了，是我太疑神疑鬼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的客人","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"阿海，汽水来一瓶！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！收您三元！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯文戴上了破旧的工业施术手套，从背后的棚屋里拿出几瓶浅黄色的汽水，双手紧握玻璃瓶，很快，玻璃瓶的表面就凝结了寒霜。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......你什么时候学会这样的源石技艺了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记不记得当时那群从北面来的战士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"你说的是......雪怪小队？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"是他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你走了之后，我带着其他几个人被编入了空降兵小队。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"很长一段时间，我们都是和雪怪小队一起行动的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这是他们教我的，我没什么源石技艺的天赋，最多只能冻几瓶汽水。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都是好人，霜星大姐也是个好人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但是后来他们都死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"所以其他人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"帕奇死在了来龙门的路上，他矿石病最严重，你知道的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"沃尔兹他......掩护其他人，被龙门的部队干掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我活着，只是因为我运气好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"我的喷射背包中途失控了，市区大战的时候，我坠落到了垃圾回收口里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"等我醒过来，战争已经结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"最可笑的是，是龙门贫民窟的拾荒者救了我，他把我从垃圾堆里挖出来，我才捡回来一条命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"路过的女孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_032","isRemote":false,"text":"阿海哥！给我一瓶汽水！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，三元。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"凯文转过身，又一次拿出了几瓶汽水。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"看看这里的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"他们，都是普通人，这里也有感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"他们都有自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"但是那个时候，我也没有想过这些事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"拿起武器的时候，我真的认为我是为了感染者而战。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"现在看来，我可能只是个拿着武器打砸抢烧的暴徒罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"到最后，我也不知道自己这几年都在干什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"现在来看，你才是那个什么都想明白的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"其实我也不是什么都想明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我啊，我不是什么志向远大的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"对我来说，能吃饱饭，有地方住，这种生活已经很好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"但是冲到别人的家里，把他们拖出来，殴打他们，伤害他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"就算我是感染者，为了生计，我也不能接受这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我讲不出什么大道理，但是这肯定不对。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我离开了整合运动。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"不过就像我说的，你还活着，这是好事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"我也该回去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你要走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......其实我也是工作之余偷跑出来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你给我的这些药......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"这些药......这得要多少钱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这你就别管了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这些不是市售药，你自己吃就行，不要让别人知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"你......稍等一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"给，送你几瓶汽水，都是我自己灌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"咱们以后，很难再见面了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"凯文","speakerId":"avg_npc_080","isRemote":false,"text":"好好活着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是，好好活着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"这么快就出来了，问完了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"算是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，具体的情况你和督察讲吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，这不是金警官么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......早上好，林先生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦了，一大清早就在执勤。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，你是刚才去找阿海的那个年轻人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"是，是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"虽然不知道出什么事了，不过阿海这小伙子人不错，你们可别为难他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林大爷","speakerId":"avg_npc_034","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，你们忙，我不打搅了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......林先生您慢走。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这位老先生是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"别问那么多了，走吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lmstreet_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"小个子的萨弗拉最后回头看了一眼这个街区。\n战争和冲突给这座城市留下的痕迹正在逐渐被覆盖。\n随着时光流逝，这些痕迹也会成为龙门的一部分，与更加遥远的历史一样。\n在破损的街道上，人们在努力地活着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"结束了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"他没问题，他已经和整合运动没什么关系了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"已经没有什么整合运动的凯文了，他现在是卖汽水的阿海。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，多一事不如少一事，这事情就这么结了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"阿金！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"我在，星熊督察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"把这个案子结了，文书报告的部分就交给你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"所以案件结论......是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"只是一个普通感染者，没什么特殊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"需要做其他留档吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"没有必要，不要节外生枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"金警官","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"......我明白了，这就去办。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还有这个，你自己拿着吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"这个是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"是针对你的调查报告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"近卫局还调查了我啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"我好歹也是龙门近卫局督察，本职工作还是要做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门的安宁来之不易，这种事情我肯定要查清楚，就算是罗德岛也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"不过现在，这只是我的个人行为，和近卫局也没什么关系，这份报告里的内容我就当它不存在了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"他是龙门市民阿海，你是罗德岛干员伊桑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"就这样吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......谢谢你，鬼姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"还有啊，不要那么叫我，你又没和我一起混过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不好意思，谢谢你，星熊警官。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊不对，督察。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你有办法回罗德岛吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"有，下周我搭办事处的车队回去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"星熊","speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊，那我就不送你了，替我向博士和老陈问声好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"没问题。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_trainingcom"},{"type":"narration","text":"半个月后"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"（就放在这吧。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月见夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"咦，这是什么？汽水？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月见夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"今天食堂提供汽水哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这个是我带来的，你们随便拿就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"月见夜","speakerId":"char_283_midn","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！我就不客气了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"斑点","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"你还是稍微客气一下吧，怎么给你一个台阶你就下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"没事，这个是朋友送的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"一个普通朋友送的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊桑","speakerId":"char_355_ethan","isRemote":false,"text":"......汽水而已。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["金警官"]},{"speakerId":"char_136_hsguma","aliases":["星熊"]},{"speakerId":"char_283_midn","aliases":["月见夜"]},{"speakerId":"char_284_spot","aliases":["斑点"]},{"speakerId":"char_355_ethan","aliases":["伊桑"]}]}
